equests that aim to enhance the usability of AnimationTree.\r\n\r\nFor BlendSpace1D and BlendSpace2D, this commit:\r\n- Changes the default tool to the select cursor, more in line with the default in BlendTree and StateMachine.\r\n- Changes the select cursor tool to be a hybrid, with support for Shift+LMB dragging to move the blend position cursor, just like how StateMachine's can create transitions.\r\n- Changes the order of the tools in the editor's toolbar to be how they are in StateMachine: LMB, RMB, Shift+LMB.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5f12b97-2249-42c4-9743-2c4bcf6e26d5\r\n\r\nMy rationale is that adding and moving points occupies most of the user's time in the BlendSpace editor, whereas blending position is mostly expected to be changed at runtime. Also, the default tool being the blend position cursor causes constant friction when navigating through nested nodes.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repit